    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_seal

    The mark of Eguahe in the seal under what a family shares (the drawing, the story, the invitation): the backpack
    drawn for small sizes by the art director (agents/arte/kit/marca-eguahe, mochila-16), alone, without its tile, so
    its shape reads at the size of a line of text: the body and its strap, the handle, and the label of the first day.
    Its colours by day are in the drawing; by night, in the sheets of the page (pub/eguahe.css, pub/cuento/cuento.css),
    and the outline of the label takes the colour of the paper under it.

